{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"setFusionConfig","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"config","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/LivenessFusionConfigurable","preciseIdentifier":"s:5YEOFR26LivenessFusionConfigurableP","text":"LivenessFusionConfigurable","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this to run FR-only, or FR + one signal, e.g. for compliance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"isolation or an A\/B. It forwards to the underlying "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustSession"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and resets the trust state so the next frame re-evaluates cold — a live"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"toggle otherwise leaves the previous verdict resident. Face recognition"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the enrolled-identity gate are unaffected; this only governs which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"anti-spoof signals contribute to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trusted"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Independent of ","type":"text"},{"code":"start(preferTrueDepth:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which selects the camera","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"hardware; ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"useTrueDepthSDK"},{"text":" governs whether the depth verdict counts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"toward trust. With a non-TrueDepth camera the depth signal is absent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"regardless of this flag.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"s:5YEOFR16FaceTrustServiceC15setFusionConfigyyxYaAA08LivenessF12ConfigurableRzlF","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"YEOFR"}],"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setFusionConfig","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LivenessFusionConfigurable","preciseIdentifier":"s:5YEOFR26LivenessFusionConfigurableP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}],"title":"setFusionConfig(_:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService\/setFusionConfig(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Turn the fused anti-spoof signals on\/off at runtime: the liveness CNN"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"useLivenessSDK"},{"type":"text","text":") and the TrueDepth 3D check ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"useTrueDepthSDK"},{"type":"text","text":"), plus"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the evidence\/depth knobs on "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/LivenessFusionConfigurable","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Both signals"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default to ON ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/LivenessFus